%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dIt's almost been an hour... They sure are taking their\ntime.\d%K%P
「都快一个小时了吧…好久啊」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dThey're in Room #4, right? I wonder what they're talking\nabout.\d%K%P
「在四号房是吧…\n那俩人现在，到底在说什么呢？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dI can't hear any screaming or crying. At least it doesn't\nsound like they're fighting.\d%K%P
「没听到有人发怒也没有哭声，\n气氛应该不会太坏吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dToko?\d%K%P
「都子？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dEarth to Toko.\d%K%P
「都子啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh? O-Oh, sorry. You wanted more tea? I'm out of snacks,\nthough.\d%K%P
「诶？啊，抱歉。\n要、再来杯茶吗？\n…不过小点心已经没有剩的了」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dNo need, I'm good.\d%K%P
「不是，我不是要那个啦」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dAh, I'll have another cup. This tea is awesome.\d%K%P
「啊，我再来一杯。\n这茶真的太好喝了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's, uh, instant tea from a big economy pack I bought\nlast year...\d%K%P
「只不过是半年前有天特价的时候买的\n家庭装的大包茶而已…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dThen you must be really good at making it! I've always\nsaid you'd make a great wife. I can and will guarantee\nit!\d%K%P
「也就是说是阳坂你泡茶的手艺好啦。\n果然你以后一定会成为一个好新娘的。\n我早就保证过了这下又证明了一遍」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere you go.\d%K%P
「来，请喝吧」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dLook, I'm not asking you to be embarrassed or show smiles\nand tears, but you could at least get angry at me...\d%K%P
「先不说害羞啦开心啦喜极而泣啦，\n至少也生个气什么的吧…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYou've got problems, man.\d%K%P
「真是别扭的性格啊」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI-I'll make you some tea next!\d%K%P
「下、下次我会泡的啦！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dThey sure are taking their time in there.\d%K%P
「话说回来，老师他们聊得真够久的啊」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dGhmhm... I'm curious. You guys are curious too, aren't\nyou?\d%K%P
「果然还是有些在意啊…\n呐，你们也挺在意的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNot at all.\d%K%P
「完全没啊」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dO-Oh.\d%K%P
「是、是嘛」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
%XS10\dThen how about you stop watching the door?\d %XE%K%P
「那你倒是冲着我们说啊…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dBut man, that was a shocker for sure. Not only was Ms.\nKouno married, but she's divorced, too...\d%K%P
「不过我还被真吓到了。\n没想到香野老师不仅结过婚，\n竟然就连离婚都有过了…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dWell, I imagine teachers don't go around telling these\nthings to everyone. I bet it's the first thing the PTA\nwould go after.\d%K%P
「嘛，毕竟老师他们平时也不怎么说这方面的事。\n要是让家长教师联合会知道了，那可就喜闻乐见了」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI wonder if the other teachers know. I heard she was\npopular among them, too.\d%K%P
「其他的老师都知道这事么？\n香野老师好像在办公室里很受欢迎的样子」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dI dunno... I imagine at the very least the headmaster and\nvice principal do.\d%K%P
「到底怎么样呢…\n虽然我觉得校长和主任应该都知道就是了」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dBut it's still a bit shocking. I was pretty happy when it\nturned out Ms. Kouno would be our homeroom teacher and\neverything.\d%K%P
「不过，果然还是稍微有点受打击的感觉啊。\n当初听说班主任是香野老师的时候本来还挺高兴的呢…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dShe's human, just like the rest of us. I don't really\ncare one way or the other, personally. Besides, being\ndivorced is kinda cool these days, isn't it?\d%K%P
「毕竟老师也是人啊。\n我其实没什么感觉，没觉得这有什么。\n而且现在领过离婚证的，反而倒有些帅帅的感觉」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dMs. Kouno hasn't done anything wrong. It's all the guy's\nfault, obviously.\d%K%P
「老师什么都没做错。\n那样的事怎么说也肯定是男方的问题」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dOh? You're on Ms. Kouno's side?\d%K%P
「嘿，你也是站在香野老师这边的啊？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dRather, the guy just rubs me the wrong way. I mean, how\ncould you just discard someone you fell in love with? I'd\nnever do that, Hinosaka.\d%K%P
「不如说，是男的这边令人不能原谅。\n把曾经喜欢过的女生像破布一样舍弃掉这干的是人事么。\n我是绝对不会这么干的，阳坂」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dWhat will you do if -you- get 'discarded' instead?\d%K%P
「那如果不是他甩了人家而是被甩了的话怎么办？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI'm not the kinda loser that would disappoint a woman\nwho's fallen for him.\d%K%P
「我可不是那种会被曾经喜欢过自己的女孩子给抛弃的\n徒有其表的男人～」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI wonder which one of them wanted to break up.\d%K%P
「到底是哪一边呢。提出要分手的人」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dThat's what it all comes down to, I guess...\d%K%P
「最后又说回到这个上面了啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI'm curious!\d%K%P
「果然还是好在意啊～」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYou don't give up, do you...\d%K%P
「你也真是爱八卦啊」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dHey, what if... what if things were actually going\n-really- well in there?\d%K%P
「呐，呐，闹不好，\n里面说不定反而缠绵悱恻着呢！」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dEven though they've already broken up?\d%K%P
「他们不都分手了么？」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dNeither of them seem to have remarried. You never know\nwhen an old flame might suddenly get rekindled.\d%K%P
「他们两人都没有再婚。\n干柴遇烈火的可能性也不能说就没有，是吧？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dSo would that make Toko -- the one who brought them back\ntogether -- a Cupid of sorts?\d%K%P
「这样的话，小都子就成了为他们两位搭桥引线\n的丘比特了么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI wouldn't forgive the guy, though. Why would anyone want\nto get back together with a loser like that?\d%K%P
「我的话还是不会轻饶了他的。\n遇到这么个不要脸的男人我送也要送他走啊」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dWhy do you keep looking at everything through a woman's\nperspective?\d%K%P
「所以说你刚才都说了些什么啊，\n完全都是从女人这边想的吧？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dI mean, no matter how you look at it, the husband guy is\nin the wrong here. I just can't stand these squirmy,\nindecisive types.\d%K%P
「因为怎么想都是老公这边不对吧？\n我啊，就忍不了这种不利索的人～」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYou haven't even met him.\d%K%P
「明明自己都没见过人家…」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dPeople trembled in fear when they heard my nickname,\n'Goal Hunter Wolf.' I'm gonna show him what a real man's\nmade of when he shows up!\d%K%P
「被冠上『goal hunter wolf』这可怕名号的我，\n这就过去“问候”他一下！」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dDoesn't sound like a goal is the only thing you're aiming\nfor here...\d%K%P
「你这名字真是让人不怎么觉得你是只想着\n进球的人啊…」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dAh, be careful, Tsuyoshi! I caught a glimpse of him\nbefore! He's an adult, and really, really tall!\d%K%P
「危、危险啊～刚志君！\n我见过那个人一次，\n不光是个大人，还长得特别的高」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dYeah, he sure was tall... and all too eager to kowtow to\nToko...\d%K%P
「确实是够高的啊。\n…不过面对都子的时候倒是经常极大地哈着腰就是了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dC'mon, enough with all that. It's not even gonna be a\nfight.\d%K%P
「还是算了吧。\n这都没得可比的」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dI-Is he that strong? Does he do stuff like karate or\nboxing, maybe?\d%K%P
「有、有那么强？\n难不成，他练过空手道或者拳击之类的？」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dHmph! It sounds like he's not gonna be a lackluster\nopponent!\d%K%P
「哼，作为对手而言没有任何不足」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI wouldn't really say so. He is pretty lacking.\nParticularly in calcium.\d%K%P
「不不，还是有不足的。\n特别在钙质之类的上」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\d...Is he like, quick to snap or something?\d%K%P
「…很容易修理吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIf anything, I'd say he's quick to break. If you apply\njust a bit of strength he'll definitely snap... in half\nlike a twig.\d%K%P
「硬要说的话，我觉着是很好撅了。\n感觉只要稍微用点力就要被掰折了似的」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dAh... that doesn't sound...\d%K%P
「啊…不，那就是说…」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\dBy the way... It's really silent in here today. I mean,\nlast time I was here, your tenants wouldn't even give us\nthe time of day.\d%K%P
「话说回来…今天还真是很安静啊。\n去年来的时候，这公寓里的人\n明明一个一个地都出来露了脸的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...?\d%K%P
「………？」%K%P
%LCMatsuru
%LC真鹤
\dAh! I remember! They brought us all sorts of games. And\nthen that grandpa put on a rakugo show for us.\d%K%P
「啊～，我还记得我还记得。\n好像还拿了好多游戏出来额～。\n之后，老爷爷突然就开始说起落语了」%K%P
%LCTsuyoshi
%LC刚志
\dWell, today's Sunday and the weather outside is real\nnice. I'm sure they're hanging out somewhere. I mean, it's\nnot like they're a bunch of weird shut-ins or anything.\d%K%P
「天气这么好的星期日，肯定都出门了吧。\n又不是家里蹲」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...?! W-Wait, I'd totally forgotten!\d%K%P
「………呃！？\n忘、忘了这茬了～！」%K%P
%LCRinko
%LC伦子
\d...Toko?\d%K%P
「…都子？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd so you ended up in a place like this...\d%K%P
「…然后就流落到这种地方来了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wouldn't phrase it like that... well, I guess it's\ntrue.\d%K%P
「什么叫流落啊…嘛，要说也是啦」%K%P
In the end, we couldn't decide on Mitoko's fate in a mere\nhour.%K%P
结果，对美都子的事该怎么处理，\n就光这几个小时也得不出什么结论。%K%P
Asami just said she'd see how Mitoko did at school for a\nfew days before considering it.%K%P
麻实只说了句『总之这件事回学校再研究』，\n之后就断了话茬。%K%P
I guess I had no choice but to leave everything to the\nschool at this point.%K%P
这之后就只能期待学校能宽大处理了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see... Life is strange, huh.\d%K%P
「是吗…理你遭了这种事啊…」%K%P
And so, after discussing someone else for a while, we\nfinally felt like shifting the subject back to ourselves.%K%P
然后，自然而然地，在说了一大通别人的话题之后，\n谈话的氛围终于转到我们各自的事情上了。%K%P
After that, words started spilling out one after another.%K%P
变成这样之后，就说得没完没了。%K%P
Our parting might have been something better left\nforgotten, but at the same time, a certain air of\nnostalgia still lingered about us.%K%P
不管当初的离别有多么痛苦，\n我们彼此果然也都不是会被过去的羁绊缠住的人啊。%K%P
We both wanted to know what the other had done since our\nseparation, and before long, we inevitably began to brag\nabout our misfortunes.%K%P
我和麻实对彼此的事都很感兴趣，从一开始聊起来\n就不断地晒起自己的不幸了。%K%P
Still, all Asami complained about were essentially\npositive things that came with the responsibility of being\na teacher and the difficulties the profession entailed.%K%P
不过，从麻实口中断断续续流露出的，\n净是身为教师的自己压力山大啊困难不断啊之后怎么办啊，\n这些比较积极的抱怨之辞。%K%P
Compared to someone like me, who had lost everything in a\nheartbeat, her problems seemed almost enviable.%K%P
和我这样的，不管是谁看了想了都会觉着很不幸的遭遇相比，\n那是多么耀眼的辛勤工作经历啊。%K%P
It was now my turn to speak and introduce her to the story\nthat would make any listener shiver -- a modern tragedy\nthrough and through.%K%P
然后现在，轮到我了。\n都不用改编润色，就能让绝大多数人\n为之震惊叹息的、真正的不幸经历。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat happened to you, Osamu? I mean, I knew you were busy\nback when we lived together, but at least you seemed to be\nenjoying your life.\d%K%P
「理你到底是怎么了啊…\n和我住在一块的时候，我记得你是，\n过着虽然累了点但十分充实的生活的啊」%K%P
Indeed. There used to be a time when I could say things\nlike \dI earn more money than I have time to spend\d with a\nstraight face.%K%P
说起来，我还有一段那种『不管挣了多少钱都没有花钱的闲暇』\n那样以无聊的忙碌为荣的时期啊。%K%P
...It might have been her turn to say that this time,\nthough.%K%P
…简直，就跟现在的她一样。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMaybe it's because Lady Luck has abandoned me for\ngood...\d%K%P
「闹不好，是因为我的幸运女神跑掉了的原因吧…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOh? You've actually learned to say things like that now?\nThat's progress. Has your personality finally caught up\nwith your outward appearance?\d%K%P
「哎呀？你也能说出这样的话了啊～。\n你进步了啊。稍微懂得了点察言观色嘛？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHaha...\d%K%P
「哈哈…」%K%P
My luck took such a turn after our separation that I might\nas well have meant the line literally.%K%P
刚刚说的真不光是说说而已，\n我离婚后的运气确实背到了极点…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see. I see. Well, your misfortunes aside, I have to say\nI'm relieved.\d%K%P
「是嘛是嘛。\n嘛，先不管你那一连串的不幸，我至少也有些安心了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dR-Really?\d%K%P
「是、是么…？」%K%P
I wondered exactly which part of my story could cause a\nperson to feel relieved.%K%P
『听了刚才的那些事到底哪能让你安下心来啊』\n虽然想这样吐槽的心情不能说没有吧。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI mean, I'm glad you managed to find new love.\d%K%P
「理你也，很好地有过了下一次的恋爱啊，真是松了口气」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
A room that had suddenly turned half-empty, its unbalanced\nstate creating a void far deeper than complete emptiness\never could.%K%P
空着半边的房间。\n虚无就在这房间中扩展开来，仿佛要吞噬整个空间。%K%P
At the time, I felt like I could never love another woman\nagain.%K%P
我之前，确实有想过\n『我已经，再也不会对女性抱有好感了』之类的。%K%P
But wounds would heal and pain would wane. You'd still get\nhungry even if you lost your stomach.%K%P
但是，伤痕会慢慢淡化，疼痛也渐渐忘却。\n腹中的情感连同痛苦在不知不觉之间消散了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's been two years, huh.\d%K%P
「那之后，过了２年了啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah.\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTwo years already...\d%K%P
「是嘛，都２年了…」%K%P
That's right. Two long years have passed.%K%P
是的，已经过去２年了。%K%P
And the passing of that time had just as big an effect on\nAsami as it did on me.%K%P
度过了这段时间的，并不是只有我。\n坐在我面前的麻实，时间肯定也在她体内平凡地流逝了。%K%P
Her looks have not changed much, though. If anything, she\nseemed to have grown even more beautiful in contrast to\nour university days.%K%P
外表上，即使与将我迷得神魂颠倒的结婚那时相比，\n除了更漂亮了这点外，其他的几乎别无二致。%K%P
And now, within this woman existed two years of her life\nthat had nothing to do with me.%K%P
而且对她而言，这与我毫无交集的这两年经历，\n一定也在她心中留下了深深的烙印。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-So... How about you, Asami?\d%K%P
「然、然后，麻实你的话…\n现在，怎么样了？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHm? What do you mean?\d%K%P
「嗯？什么怎么样了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... You haven't... remarried or anything?\d%K%P
「呃，那个………比如说，再婚之类的」%K%P
Phew, I managed to squeeze that out with no weird mishaps.\nI was getting better at this.%K%P
这话说得我自己都吓着了，\n就凭我竟然还真能把如此一针见血的问题给从嘴里说出来了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDon't you think the odds of that are pretty low,\nconsidering my last name?\d%K%P
「…你不觉得只要我还用着香野这个姓氏，\n就几乎没什么那样的可能么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut I hear it's becoming popular to use your old surname\nat work.\d%K%P
「但是最近在职场上不少人都是结婚了还沿用旧姓的啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm a Kouno through and through, legally and in all other\nways. ...Relieved?\d%K%P
「现在我不论公私都姓香野啊。\n除此之外再没有别的什么称谓了。\n…这下安心了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yeah... I see. That's grea--\d%K%P
