The last employee he had yet to take care of was his own\nniece, Amagi Kaya.%K%P
最后留下来的，\n只有大概是社长的侄女的职员…\n天城夏夜小姐一人。%K%P
I see... So that was why she stayed behind for so long.%K%P
这样啊…所以虽然别的员工都纷纷离开了，\n却只有她一个人留了下来。%K%P
Indeed, despite her outwardly callous attitude, she was a\nthoroughly kind, perhaps even somewhat naive person.%K%P
确实，她和自己那双冷彻的双眼恰恰相反，\n是个非常温柔，简直有点幼稚的人啊。%K%P
%LCPresident of Houei Commerce
%LC邦永商会社长
