%LC美都子
\dI noticed this back when you came to visit, but... You\nalways wear really high heels, don't you?\d%K%P
「上次您来我家的时候我也在想啊…\n老师，您一直都穿着那种跟好高的高跟鞋啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI always had to look up when speaking to you, which\nhonestly wasn't very comfortable. But now it all makes\nsense.\d%K%P
「跟你说话的时候老是得抬着头。\n说真的，这样讲话也挺累的。\n不过，原来是这么回事啊…」%K%P
