%LC美都子
\dYou brought us pasta the other day, and now you order\ncappuccino... You know, it's just... Hmph...\d%K%P
「您带来的意面也是，这杯卡布奇诺也是。\n总感觉，总觉着吧…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAre you...\d%K%P
「你是说…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere, this is for my drinks. Oh, and keep the change.\d%K%P
「给，这是我的那份。\n啊，就不用再找我啦」%K%P
