By the way, I personally am close to my limit. I've been\nconcentrating on feints and fake motions of drinking to\nfool my companion's eyes.%K%P
顺道一提我从刚才就已经濒临极限了，\n一直只是小心翼翼地偷偷舔着杯子沿。%K%P
