At least I finally managed to get used to calling her that\nduring this past hour.%K%P
总而言之，就限于这一个小时，\n称呼什么的我就从了她了。%K%P
Unfortunately, it was unlikely I'd have much of an\nopportunity to put this newfound skill to good use for\nlong.%K%P
但是，能像这样二人独处的时间，\n其实已经差不多所剩无几了。%K%P
The earliest morning train would leave in an hour, and\nboth of us were pretty much completely out of money, too.%K%P
距离头班车出站，还有一个多小时。\n在过了这一小段时间后，我们互相，\n就又是两个没有什么交集的人了。%K%P
