%LC夏夜
\dYou reek of sweat.\d%K%P
「体味好重」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry...\d%K%P
「对不起…」%K%P
I hadn't been home since Wednesday.%K%P
从周三开始，一直都没有回过房间。%K%P
I managed to bathe and change underwear at a sauna\nestablishment next to our office, but my clothes were a\nreal mess.%K%P
就只在公司附近的桑拿房洗了个澡，换了换内衣，\n衬衫和领带已经皱皱巴巴的了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhy go that far? You did realize that you were just being\nused, right?\d%K%P
「为什么要勉强到这个份上啊？\n自己遭受了多么过分的对待，你心中有数吗？」%K%P
