%LC理
\dLet's just say it turned out to be an educational\nexperience...\d%K%P
「这也是一次珍贵的社会体验吧…」%K%P
Wonder how many more of those I'll need...%K%P
“你要体验几回才算完啊”，\n好像之前有被谁这样说过来着。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo... what now?\d%K%P
「今后…要怎么办？」%K%P
Here we go...%K%P
终于…%K%P
This was the one... well, one of the issues I would've\npreferred not to broach today.%K%P
今天，我是唯独不想回答这个问题啊，\n就只有这一句…不，是为数不多的禁句之一吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, I suppose I'll take a short break. ...A really\nshort one.\d%K%P
「总而言之，就先休息一小阵吧。\n…真的，就一小阵」%K%P
Although from my experience, I could predict that this\nwould most likely prove to be a very long vacation.%K%P
从到目前为止的经验上来看，\n其实我觉得，这恐怕会演变成一次漫长的假期吧。%K%P
Still, I wanted to envision a brighter future, even if all\nit amounted to was running from the truth.%K%P
就算如此，我仍然期待着会出现不同的未来图景。%K%P
But right now, I found my heart and soul too exhausted to\npicture a future like that, let alone answer questions\nabout it.%K%P
但是现在的话，我的精神已经虚弱到\n描绘不出那种期待的程度了，所以不想被问及。%K%P
