%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm gonna be okay. I'm gonna figure something out. ...I'm\nused to being alone.\d%K%P
「没关系的。\n总能、想办法过去的。\n…我也，一个人处惯了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dReally...?\d%K%P
「是么…？」%K%P
If I was really alone, I could still manage.%K%P
一个人的话，还能忍得住。%K%P
I mean, I was in the exact same situation last year, but I\nstill managed to get through it.%K%P
去年也，几乎一整年都是这种状态，\n就算如此我也，想方设法熬过来了。%K%P
But now...%K%P
但是，现在…%K%P
Would I be able to handle it in a room with constant\nvisitors?%K%P
在我那总是被大家陪伴着的房间里，\n我不知道我到底还能不能承受得住。%K%P
Today was supposed to be my salary day.%K%P
今天，本来应该是，发薪日的。%K%P
Mr. Retired and the others no doubt had a party I'd be\npaying for all planned out already.%K%P
老爷子也好大家也是，肯定都等着看我的收入，\n筹划着彻夜通宵的庆祝计划吧。%K%P
And among the invitees...%K%P
然后，在那一圈人中间…%K%P
...there would most likely be a single girl who -- albeit\noutwardly grumbling and complaining -- might go out of her\nway to take a day off from her delivery job just to\ncongratulate me.%K%P
说不好还有，这只有这一天，在送完报纸之后好不容易休息一下，\n在旁边指指点点发着牢骚的万绿丛中一点红。%K%P
