%LC理
\dSo... Why don't we speak about something else?\d%K%P
「所以…\n这个话题，就说这么多吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I didn't expect this to hit me so hard.%K%P
会有这么大反应，\n我自己都没想到。%K%P
Nor that I'd ever find it difficult to return to that\nbright, lively room.%K%P
回到那间热闹的屋子竟会如此令我苦痛…\n我从来没想过，会有这样一天。%K%P
