%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, maybe you could give me a bit more space.\d%K%P
「还不是因为你特意靠过来闻吗」%K%P
She rested her head on my shoulder, sniffing my neck like\na small dog might.%K%P
把脸伸到我的脸下面，\n闻闻闻，简直就像家里养的小狗把鼻子伸了过来似的。%K%P
I admit that it made my heart race quite a bit, but I had\ntrouble reacting because of all the alcohol coursing\nthrough my blood.%K%P
说实话，我也有点慌神，不过，\n因为喝醉了的缘故，身体也没能及时反应过来，\n对她刚才的行为。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou should take a shower. Right now.\d%K%P
「去冲个澡吧，就现在去」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut there's still time before the first train... So why\ndon't we drink for a little while longer?\d%K%P
「但是，距离首班车，还有时间…\n所以再稍微，喝上两杯吧？」%K%P
And even if the trains were already running now, I'm not\nsure... I wanted to go home early.%K%P
而且，就算首发车开走了也罢，\n现在…我也不想那么早回去。%K%P
I wanted to sit here until the place closed. I needed more\ntime to collect myself...%K%P
在我做好心理准备之前…\n至少到关门吧，我还想在这待会儿。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt's all right.\d%K%P
「没事的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat is? To be perfectly honest, I don't even have enough\ncash to pay for a sauna right now.\d%K%P
「什么啊？\n事先声明啊，我可已经没有去洗桑拿的钱了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dActually, I live about ten minutes from here.\d%K%P
「其实我的房间，\n从这走过去要不了１０分钟」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d.........Excuse me?\d%K%P
「………………什么？」%K%P
It wasn't like I couldn't figure out where this was\nheaded.%K%P
说实话，我其实并不是不知道她说的话\n到底是什么意思…%K%P
But I was too drunk to properly respond...%K%P
但是，因为喝的太多了…\n脑子，有点转不过来了…%K%P
And so...%K%P
所以说我就…%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dCome over to my place...\d%K%P
「到{房间:我家}来吧…」%K%P
